    "text": "ynamically, avoiding peak start-up current spikes.\n\n## Standby Power & Smart Management\n- **Vampire Loads**: Electronics on standby mode (TVs, chargers, microwave clocks) account for 5% to 10% of residential power bills. Using smart power strips or switching off wall outlets stops idle consumption.\n- **Rooftop Solar PV Systems**: Installing a 3 kW residential rooftop solar photovoltaic system reduces household emissions by approximately 3.5 to 4 metric tons of CO2 per year.",
