    "text": "fuel efficiency for every 45 kg (100 lbs) removed.\n\n## Sustainable Commuting Alternatives\n- **Public Transit Integration**: Switching from a single-occupancy vehicle to bus or urban rail reduces personal daily commute emissions by 45% to 75%.\n- **Active Mobility (Bicycles & Walking)**: For journeys under 3 km, walking or cycling produces zero operational carbon emissions and eliminates parking congestion.\n- **Electric Vehicles (EVs)**: Transitioning from an Internal Combustion Engine (ICE) vehicle to a battery electric vehicle reduces lifetime emissions by 50% to 70%, even when accounting for current power grid energy mixes.",
